Z||000000||GREENDANO||12-14-1999||09:09 PM||||Hey everybody,<BR>  I need to talk to the guys with the 22P books.  I work at a Cad/Olds dealership and all I can find for a winshield wiper switch is dicontinued.  The problem is I have 2 speed wipers (no delay) with tilt wheel.  GM doesn't even list a switch for that application.  <BR>  Any help?<BR>  Dan-O||||reg||1
